The Work

You will test how AI assistants handle realistic analytics workflows connected to cloud data warehouses. Your work will cover anomaly investigations, KPI reporting, data refreshes, and checks of AI-generated figures, SQL, joins, filters, and time windows.

Write and run SQL queries to compare AI-generated results with source data.
Check reported metrics for aggregation, logic, and subtle accuracy errors.
Maintain, reset, and manage seeded Snowflake datasets so evaluation scenarios remain accurate and repeatable.
Manage Snowflake warehouse roles, permissions, grants, and access controls.
Configure and document connectivity and authentication across analytics and SaaS platforms.
Investigate undocumented product behavior and record your findings clearly.
Join calibration sessions to keep grading and scoring consistent across evaluators.
